        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"14579b8d-2cd7-4ccb-89fa-222650cf40b7\",\"review_text\":\"I really like the displays\"},{\"review_id\":\"53999a86-4dcb-4eef-9ce6-5046bd063d90\",\"review_text\":\"Being notified an artist I follow has released new music is important. Bring that feature back!! \\\"You can choose to hear from us about news, offers, concert recommendations, artist updates, and more. We also send you security updates for your digital safety.\\\" I need in app notifications about artists I follow nothing more nothing less and I certainly don't need notifications to my email?!?!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"d00e762b-5f8c-40b8-8364-744151aa828a\",\"review_text\":\"If there would be a option to rate 0.00005 then obviously I would do that ..THIS APP IS JUST MADE FOR RICH PEOPLE...WHO HAVE MONEY FOR THOSE NONSENSE PREMIUMS 😠😠😠😠😠😠😠😠😠😠😠😠😠 ONE OF THE GREEDY APP EVER 🤮. EVERYTHING BECOMES PREMIUM.....even you can't hear your favourite musics continuously.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c64af4d8-ac17-48fe-ae38-fd54b41b16b1\",\"review_text\":\"Latest update is stupid. App says no internet connection available, but clearly I do otherwise how else did would I have downloaded the update? Magic??\"},{\"review_id\":\"94dfde2f-2a0a-48e2-8c01-ff60753f1bce\",\"review_text\":\"the app is really good get any audio book any songs any languages are recommended this app really good love you spotify, ❤️❤️😍\"},{\"review_id\":\"df643965-43d1-42bc-9cb7-65a069c9feea\",\"review_text\":\"Great selection. But, Spotify needs to get on the HD train like Amazon, Tidal and Apple.\"},{\"review_id\":\"13f95fa1-8ce6-42f6-9d2a-d5a7e5d72d87\",\"review_text\":\"Bedha app\"},{\"review_id\":\"95289258-a9a7-4741-a977-b9b39c0a1d42\",\"review_text\":\"I like the quality of the song. Can spotify make yearly subscription, so the fee will be cheaper?\"},{\"review_id\":\"863f20bd-acc2-47bc-a6b3-0a7519d6d221\",\"review_text\":\"Premium is way overpriced and the free version is absolutely saturated with adds. I recommend listening to the radio more than downloading this app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"00821b00-e0db-4b26-a833-5719efe71595\",\"review_text\":\"I byycot of swedan\"}]}"
